{"benchmark": "livebench_selected", "task_id": "paraphrase:d2adc0a1fad83dc359b9b10550d05c3b551685dbd85ca6f9f68721a7ecdc4785", "sample_idx": 33, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " [[News Article about Online Course and Media Consumption]]\n\nHand in hand, the world of online courses and media consumption have become inseparable companions in today's digital age. With just a click, one can access a vast array of learning materials from the comfort of their home, making education more accessible than ever before. The notion of a 'stranger' teaching a 'course' has become commonplace, as experts from all corners of the globe share their knowledge with eager learners.\n\nParagraph 1\n------------\n\nThe hand of technology has transformed the way we consume media and learn new skills. With the advent of online courses, individuals no longer have to be confined to a traditional classroom setting. Instead, they can learn from a 'stranger' who is an expert in their chosen field, no matter where they are located in the world. This new form of education has opened up a wealth of opportunities for those who may not have had access to such resources before.\n\nParagraph 2\n------------\n\nMoreover, the sun of digitalization has brought about a significant shift in media consumption habits. People are now consuming media in new and innovative ways, with online courses being just one example. The convenience and accessibility of online learning platforms have made it possible for individuals to fit education into their busy schedules. Whether it's watching a video tutorial during a lunch break or completing an online assignment on the go, the possibilities are endless.\n\nParagraph 3\n------------\n\nHowever, as with any new technology, there are rules and terms and conditions that come with it. It is essential to be aware of these guidelines to ensure a positive and productive online learning experience. By adhering to these rules, individuals can m